<title>USA: I-Flow says exploring acquisitions.</title>
<headline>I-Flow says exploring acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>I-FLOW Corp said it hired the investment banking firm Wedbush Morgan Securities to help it identify and evaluate potential acquisitions and strategic partnerships.</p>
<p>I-FLOW designs, develops, and markets ambulatory infusion systems that deliver fluids for a variety of medical treatments in the home, alternate site/outpatient centers and hospitals.</p>
